<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>吐血 - 标签 - 观颐斋</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/tags/%E5%90%90%E8%A1%80/</link><description>观以明理，颐以养正</description><follow_challenge><feedId>150502341826627584</feedId><userId>ZnkTaajoold86nK1rOZmQsDmDM1cgXMP</userId></follow_challenge><generator>Hugo 0.161.1 &amp; FixIt v0.4.5</generator><language>zh-cn</language><managingEditor>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</managingEditor><webMaster>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</webMaster><lastBuildDate>Wed, 06 May 2026 17:59:52 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://acuherb.xyz/tags/%E5%90%90%E8%A1%80/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>敛治法：论亡阳 论下血 论吐血 论头汗 论手汗</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/2-24-lianzhifa/</link><pubDate>Wed, 06 May 2026 17:57:52 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/2-24-lianzhifa/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E5%8D%B7%E4%BA%8C%E4%B9%90%E9%9B%86/">卷二乐集</category><description>本节为《石室秘录》“敛治法”部分，专论&lt;strong&gt;气、血、汗&lt;/strong&gt;等将要耗散时的收敛固脱法则。核心思想是：&lt;strong&gt;气将散而收敛之&lt;/strong&gt;，但不可一味酸收寒遏，当以&lt;strong&gt;补为敛&lt;/strong&gt;，使正气固而散者自归。</description></item><item><title>偏治法：论治心痛 论上热下寒 论两胁胀满 论胃气痛脾不化食 论痿 论厥 论吐血 论治头痛腰背手足痛 论梦遗 喘嗽 口眼歪斜 目痛</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/1-11-pianzhifa/</link><pubDate>Fri, 24 Apr 2026 10:15:52 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/1-11-pianzhifa/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E5%8D%B7%E4%B8%80%E7%A4%BC%E9%9B%86/">卷一礼集</category><description>本节为《石室秘录》“偏治法”部分，论述&lt;strong&gt;不直接针对病变部位施治，而根据脏腑生克关系从他处入手&lt;/strong&gt;的独特治法。核心思想是：&lt;strong&gt;病在上治下，病在左治右，病在四肢治腹心，病在此脏而治彼脏&lt;/strong&gt;。</description></item></channel></rss>